What is a Mobile Measurement Partner (MMP)?
A Mobile Measurement Partner (MMP) serves as an independent third-party platform that tracks and analyzes user engagement metrics across mobile applications. These platforms leverage technologies including SDKs (Software Development Kits) and APIs (Application Programming Interfaces) to measure key performance indicators such as app installs, in-app purchases, and ad impressions. MMPs provide advertisers and developers with data-driven insights to optimize marketing spend, enhance user acquisition strategies, and ensure compliance with global privacy regulations.
